  sentences:
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: Okay, so I was thinking about my song last night
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: Anyway, I couldnt sleep because I kept humming it in my head
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: So I woke up super early, like 5 in the morning early
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: And then I realized I forgot to do my homework, so I did it in the cafeteria
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: The cafeteria food this morning was actually really good though!
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: They made pancakes, and I had three
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: Oh! And on my way here a bird almost stole my sandwich
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: I swear it was staring at me the whole time
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: Then in class my teacher called on me when I wasnt listening
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: I said the first thing that came to mind and it was somehow right!
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: Im pretty sure it was just luck, but I felt like a genius
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: Oh and my brother texted me about my aunt visiting next week
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: She says she wants to hear my new songs, so now Im kind of nervous
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: But being nervous is okay, it means I care about it, right?
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80dcb48fbb1330d429e183522d24df8f, type: 2}
    text: Sorry, I talk a lot when Im excited
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
